<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>StockifyPro | Free csv stock spreadsheet</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="css/style.css" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <nav>
      <p href="/" class="logo">StockifyPro</p>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="/">Home</a></li>
        <li><a href="/">About Us</a></li>
        <li>
          <div class="start_button">
            <a href="/download-page">Get Started</a>
          </div>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </nav>
    <section>
      <div class="header-download">
        <h6>Welcome!</h6>
        <p>
          By clicking the button below, you should see a CSV file pop up in the
          bottom left of your screen. Double click it, and the file should open
          with the top daily gainers of the day (news on stocks coming soon).
          Our data is updated throughout the day to insure that it is the most
          up to date, so all you need to do is click the button below to get
          started.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <a id="button" href="../scraping/DailyGainers.csv" download
          >Generate Stocks</a
        >
      </div>
    </section>
  </body>
